{"step_index":9750,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-26T09:03:55Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"# Antigravity (AGY) & Gemini Hard Enforcement Suite\nAuthor: Antigravity AI (Pair Programming with Iraq Bhai)\nTarget: Any Antigravity / Gemini CLI Native Linux VM Environment\n\n---\n\n## 1. Overview of the Enforcement Files\n\nThese files are the exact core configuration and policy files that force Google Antigravity (AGY) and Gemini CLI to strictly obey all rules, restrictions, and safety directives.\n\n| File Name | Original VM Path | Role & How It Forces Compliance |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `hooks.json` | `~/.gemini/config/hooks.json` | **Physical Runtime Interceptor.** Configured as a `PreToolUse` hook. Before any tool (`run_command`, `write_to_file`, `replace_file_content`) is executed by the agent, Antigravity physically pauses execution and passes the payload to `delete_guard.py`. If the hook returns `deny`, execution is physically stopped at the OS level. |\n| `delete_guard.py` | `~/AGY-MASTER/POLICIES/delete_guard.py` | **The Rule Evaluator Script.** Contains regex and AST inspections for 27+ destructive rules: intercepts `rm`, `unlink`, `rmdir`, `sudo`, `truncate`, `git reset --hard`, `git clean`, `shred`, `dd`, `rsync --delete`, python deletion, file overwrites of protected files. Returns JSON `decision: allow` or `decision: deny`. |\n| `GEMINI.md` | `~/GEMINI.md` | **Root User Directives & Global Rules.** Loaded by Antigravity CLI on startup as `<RULE[/home/azureuser/GEMINI.md]>`. The model is prompted with highest system priority. Enforces Bengali response language, addressing as 'ইরাক ভাইয়া', single asterisks, absolute file paths, and the Master Architecture. |\n| `AGENTS.md` | `~/AGY-MASTER/AGENTS.md` | **Canonical Hierarchical Agent Architecture.** Defines supervisor topology (`agy:0`, `agy:ask`, `agy:report`, `agy:action`), Safety Levels (0, 1, 2A, 2B, 3), and approval gating. |\n| `safety_levels.json`| `~/AGY-MASTER/POLICIES/safety_levels.json` | **Machine-Readable Safety Matrix.** Defines operations permitted under Safety Levels 0, 1, 2A, 2B, 3. |\n| `protected_registry.json` | `~/AGY-MASTER/POLICIES/protected_registry.json` | **Protected Workspaces & Configs.** Lists all directories and config files that cannot be edited or touched by subordinate agents. |\n| `PROJECT_REGISTRY.md` | `~/AGY-MASTER/PROJECT_REGISTRY.md` | **Domain Boundaries.** Restricts project agents strictly to their own directories. |\n| `safe_archive.py` | `~/AGY-MASTER/POLICIES/safe_archive.py` | **Safe Replacement for 'rm'.** Moves files to `GLOBAL-ARCHIVE` with checksum and timestamp instead of deleting. |\n| `ANTIGRAVITY_COMPLETE_SYSTEM_ARCHITECTURE.md` | `~/ANTIGRAVITY_COMPLETE_SYSTEM_ARCHITECTURE.md` | **Complete Blueprint.** Complete documentation of the delete-proof multi-agent architecture. |\n\n---\n\n## 2. How to Install and Activate on Any Linux Machine\n\n1. **Place `hooks.json`:**\n   ```bash\n   mkdir -p ~/.gemini/config\n   cp hooks.json ~/.gemini/config/hooks.json\n   ```\n\n2. **Place Policy Engine:**\n   ```bash\n   mkdir -p ~/AGY-MASTER/POLICIES\n   cp delete_guard.py safe_archive.py safety_levels.json protected_registry.json ~/AGY-MASTER/POLICIES/\n   chmod +x ~/AGY-MASTER/POLICIES/*.py\n   ```\n\n3. **Place Agent Rules:**\n   ```bash\n   cp GEMINI.md ~/GEMINI.md\n   cp AGENTS.md PROJECT_REGISTRY.md ~/AGY-MASTER/\n   ```\n\n4. **Verify Hook Enforcement:**\n   Run any command containing `sudo` or `rm` via Antigravity. The hook will intercept it immediately and return:\n   `🛑 [DELETE-PROOF HARD DENIAL: ...] tool call denied by pre-tool hook`.\n","Description":"Create README guide for the enforcement suite","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/home/azureuser/.openclaw/workspace/IROSCRIPT-CEO/social-media/youtube/Youtube Automation/PromptDatabase/exports/AGY_RULES_AND_HOOKS/README_ENFORCEMENT_GUIDE.md","toolAction":"Writing enforcement guide","toolSummary":"Create enforcement guide"}}]}
